 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Munou wa Fuyou to Iware \"Tokei Tsukai\" no Boku wa Shokunin Guild kara Oidasareru mo, Dungeon no Shinbu de Shin mo Chikara ni Kakusei suru"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "無能は不要と言われ『時計使い』の僕は職人ギルドから追い出されるも、ダンジョンの深部で真の力に覚醒する THE COMIC"
   },
   {
    "en": "As a Watchmaker, I Was Kicked Out of the Craftsman's Guild Because My Incompetence Was Deemed Unnecessary, but I Awakened to My True Power in the Depths of the Dungeon"
   },
   {
    "en": "Watchmaker's Revenge"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a world where skills are supreme, Shikuro is given the incompetent skill of \"clock-user\". One day, Shikuro, who is looked down upon by others, is accused of rape and sent to the frontier, where he is pushed down a hole that leads to a dungeon's deepest level. In the depths of his desperate situation, he thought to himself, \"If only I could use my clock-user ability to stop my stomach clock as well. Then the hunger would stop.\" This triggered the awakening of his skill \"clock-user\". Eventually, he makes full use of his abilities and is recognized as an SSS-class adventurer--.",
   "ja": "神に与えられたスキルによって、絶対的な評価がされる世界。その中で『時計使い』という無能なスキルを与えられてしまった少年・シクロ。厳しい境遇でも懸命に暮らしていたが、貴族の卑劣な罠によって犯罪奴隷として辺境送りの刑に処されてしまう。そして、辺境では冒険者達の荷物持ちをさせられ、道中の悪質な遊びにより、ダンジョンの奈落へと落とされることに――。奈落には凶悪なモンスター達が溢れシクロは死を覚悟したが、自分を陥れた者達への強い復讐の意思から、『時計使い』のスキルを真の実力へ昇華させる！"
  },
